            ("G066", "Non-Linear MLP Multimodal Fusion Head (256+36 -> 128 -> 1)", "A 2-layer MLP head models non-linear interactions between RR irregularity metrics and morphology features.", "Fusion head: Linear(292, 128) -> GELU -> Linear(128, 1).", 1064513, 16655000, "responses: (B, M, 16, 128), operators: (B, M, 8), rr_features: (B, 36), mask: (B, M)", "P1", "Stage 2", "Captures joint non-linear decision boundaries for complex paroxysmal episodes."),
